fetchItem, url: https://cursor.com mergedData: {
  link: 'https://cursor.com',
  name: 'cursor',
  description: 'An AI coding agent that turns ideas into code, accelerating software development by automating tasks for you.',
  introduction: '## What is Cursor?\n' +
    '\n' +
    "Cursor is an AI-powered code editor and development environment designed to act as an autonomous coding agent. It moves beyond simple code completion to understand your entire project's context and execute complex, multi-step tasks.\n" +
    '\n' +
    '### Key Features\n' +
    '\n' +
    '*   **Agentic Development:** Hand off high-level tasks like "build a landing page" or "fix CI failures" to the AI. Cursor plans, generates code, and tests it while you focus on high-level decisions.\n' +
    '*   **Cloud & Parallel Agents:** Agents can run autonomously on dedicated cloud machines, performing tasks end-to-end in parallel, allowing you to review completed work later.\n' +
    '*   **Integrated Ecosystem:** Works directly in your terminal (CLI), integrates with Slack for team collaboration, and can automatically review pull requests on GitHub.\n' +
    '*   **Automation Engine:** Set up always-on agents on schedules or triggers to automatically build, maintain, and fix repetitive aspects of your software.\n' +
    '*   **Best-in-Class Models:** Access a marketplace of cutting-edge AI models from providers like OpenAI, Anthropic, Gemini, and its own proprietary models (e.g., Grok, Composer).\n' +
    '\n' +
    '### Use Cases\n' +
    '\n' +
    '*   **Rapid Prototyping & Feature Development:** Quickly scaffold new features, components, or entire applications from a description.\n' +
    '*   **Bug Fixing & Maintenance:** Automate the diagnosis and repair of issues like failing CI builds or codebase-wide updates.\n' +
    '*   **Code Review & Refactoring:** Analyze large codebases for improvements, security issues, or adherence to standards.\n' +
    '*   **Onboarding & Exploration:** Understand unfamiliar codebases faster by having the AI agent explain and navigate the code.\n' +
    '\n' +
    'It is trusted by teams at companies like Stripe, NVIDIA, and Figma to significantly boost engineering productivity.',
  categories: [ 'Developer Tools' ],
  tags: [ 'AI', 'Coding', 'Productivity', 'Automation' ],
  image: 'https://ptht05hbb1ssoooe.public.blob.vercel-storage.com/assets/og/opengraph-default.png',
  icon: 'https://icons.duckduckgo.com/ip3/cursor.com.ico'
}
