  description: 'Magic Studio is an AI-powered online tool for creating, editing, and enhancing images for product pages, ads, and social media.',
  introduction: '# Magic Studio\n' +
    '\n' +
    'Magic Studio is an AI-powered online platform designed to democratize professional image creation and editing. It enables anyone, regardless of design skill, to produce high-quality visuals for e-commerce, marketing, and social media within minutes.\n' +
    '\n' +
    '## Core Features & Tools\n' +
    '\n' +
    '### 1. AI Image Editing\n' +
    '*   **Magic Eraser:** Instantly remove unwanted objects, people, text, or blemishes from photos using a simple brush stroke.\n' +
    '*   **Background Remover:** Effortlessly isolate subjects by removing or changing any image background.\n' +
    '*   **Background Blur:** Add a professional, portrait-like blur effect to photo backgrounds.\n' +
    '\n' +
    '### 2. AI Generation & Enhancement\n' +
    '*   **AI Image Generator:** Create original images from text descriptions.\n' +
    '*   **AI Art Generator:** Generate artistic visuals, graphics, and illustrations.\n' +
    '*   **Image Upscaler:** Increase image resolution up to 4K without quality loss.\n' +
    '\n' +
    '### 3. Practical Utilities\n' +
    '*   Includes format converters like **HEIC to JPG** and **WEBP to PNG**.\n' +
    '\n' +
    '## Use Cases\n' +
    '\n' +
    '*   **E-commerce:** Quickly create clean product photos, remove clutter from listings, and generate promotional images.\n' +
    '*   **Marketing & Ads:** Produce eye-catching social media posts, ad creatives, and blog illustrations.\n' +
    '*   **Content Creation:** Edit personal photos, generate concept art, and enhance visual content for any project.\n' +
    '\n' +
    '## Accessibility\n' +
    '\n' +
    'Magic Studio is available as a web application and has dedicated apps for both iOS and Android, allowing users to start editing on mobile and continue on desktop for more advanced control.',
